# Assessment checklist

- Read [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) first. It is the source of truth.
- Required work in order: Top Movies epic, then Favorites stories 1 and 2.
- Do not try to finish the backlog. Judgment over completion count.
- All new work is SwiftUI. Top Movies fixes stay in the existing UIKit list.
- No 3rd-party dependencies.
- Unit tests for completed work.
- Tick `Done` and the progress table only after tests and a visual check.
- Ship work through PRs; reviewers look at `main`.
- Commits stay reviewable (one story or logical unit) — see [`commits.mdc`](.cursor/rules/commits.mdc).
